        <activityName xml:lang="en">Road construction, foundation layer, installation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Road construction, foundation layer, installation
Modern European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 428fc831-4190-4466-897f-0eda0ddba80c
This process represents the installation of one ton of asphalt foundation layer in road construction, including the laying and compaction activities.
Location: Europe
Technology: Generic process for different types of asphalt foundation layers and varying shares of recycled asphalt (RAP).
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_428fc831-4190-4466-897f-0eda0ddba80c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
